OL,3,GNEWSAWest raises thousands for Nepalese
OL,4,Aflood victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople across the West of England have
OL,7,Fraised thousands of pounds for
OL,8,Fsurvivors of the Nepalese flash floods
OL,9,Fthrough buffets, vigils and
OL,10,Ffundraisers.
OL,12,FKabul Maharjan, who lives in Yate, said
OL,13,Fhis relatives "lost everything" in the
OL,14,FAugust floods that were unleashed by an
OL,15,Favalanche of rock and ice on the
OL,16,FNepal-Tibet border, killing more than
OL,17,F1,400 people.
OL,19,FSince then, Maharjan, along with his
OL,20,Fwider family, has raised about #20,000
OL,21,Fto support the victims.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
