OL,3,GNEWSAWest raises thousands for Nepalese
OL,4,Aflood victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FElsewhere, a fundraising buffet event
OL,7,Ftook place at Yak Yeti Yak on Sunday in
OL,8,FBath, and the Nepalese Association of
OL,9,FWiltshire held a candlelight vigil in
OL,10,FSwindon on Saturday for those affected.
